flowchart TD
    Start([📱 Client Request]) --> Gateway[API Gateway<br/>NestJS Backend]
    
    Gateway --> Auth{Authentication<br/>Required?}
    
    Auth -->|Public Endpoint| Validate
    Auth -->|Protected| CheckToken{Valid<br/>Token?}
    
    CheckToken -->|No Token| Error401[❌ 401<br/>Authentication Required]
    CheckToken -->|Invalid| Error401
    CheckToken -->|Valid ✓| RateLimit
    
    RateLimit{Rate Limit<br/>Check}
    RateLimit -->|Exceeded| Error429[❌ 429<br/>Too Many Requests]
    RateLimit -->|OK ✓| RBAC
    
    RBAC{Authorization<br/>Role & Permissions}
    RBAC -->|Denied| Error403[❌ 403<br/>Access Denied]
    RBAC -->|Authorized ✓| Validate
    
    Validate{Input<br/>Validation}
    Validate -->|Invalid| Error400[❌ 400<br/>Validation Failed]
    Validate -->|Valid ✓| Business
    
    Business[Business Logic<br/>UseCase Layer]
    Business --> TxCheck{Transaction<br/>Required?}
    
    TxCheck -->|No| DirectDB
    TxCheck -->|Yes| BeginTx[🔄 BEGIN Transaction]
    
    BeginTx --> DBOps[Database Operations<br/>PostgreSQL]
    DirectDB[Direct Query] --> DBResult
    DBOps --> DBResult{Operation<br/>Result}
    
    DBResult -->|Error| DBError{Error<br/>Type}
    DBError -->|Connection| Error503[❌ 503<br/>Service Unavailable]
    DBError -->|Constraint| Error409[❌ 409<br/>Conflict]
    DBError -->|Not Found| Error404[❌ 404<br/>Not Found]
    DBError -->|Business Rule| Error422[❌ 422<br/>Business Rule Violated]
    DBError -->|Other| Error500[❌ 500<br/>Internal Error]
    
    DBResult -->|Success ✓| AuditCheck{Audit<br/>Required?}
    
    AuditCheck -->|No| Commit
    AuditCheck -->|Yes| Audit[📋 Audit Log]
    Audit --> Commit
    
    Commit{In<br/>Transaction?}
    Commit -->|No| Success
    Commit -->|Yes| CommitTx[✅ COMMIT]
    
    CommitTx --> CommitResult{Commit<br/>OK?}
    CommitResult -->|Failed| Error500
    CommitResult -->|Success ✓| Success
    
    Success{Response<br/>Type}
    Success -->|Created| Response201[✅ 201 Created<br/>Resource Created]
    Success -->|Updated| Response200[✅ 200 OK<br/>Success]
    Success -->|Deleted| Response204[✅ 204 No Content<br/>Deleted]
    
    Response201 --> Client
    Response200 --> Client
    Response204 --> Client
    Error401 --> Client
    Error403 --> Client
    Error404 --> Client
    Error409 --> Client
    Error422 --> Client
    Error429 --> Client
    Error500 --> Client
    Error503 --> Client
    
    Client([📱 Client Receives Response<br/>Standard JSON Format])
    
